(
    title: "Cave Noire",
    developer: Some("Konami"),
    description: Some("Four randomly generated dungeons sit outside the village of Karuzu, each set to one of four quests — kill monsters, free fairies, gather gold or orbs — across ten difficulties. Every run is one chance: reach the target and you bank the level, die and the dungeon is thrown away and rebuilt. Turn-based, top-down, with items to tilt the odds."),
